/******************************************
Created by: Mason Newman
Date: February 2026

Originally written for WIZNET W5100S-EVB-PICO2 (RP2350)

This sketch was created to display dynamic sprites and text on custom HMI graphics.
The display is a 5.0: 800x480 40-pin TFT driven by the Adafruit RA8875 driver board.
Large bitmaps were made to display backgrounds and logos. Small bitmaps were created for sprites.
Dynamic elements like the bar graophs and numeric display were created using hardware accelerated shape draw functions.
All f the elements were designed for speed and clarity. 
This MCU only recieves data from the Ammeter_analog MCU and displays it. 
This reduces overhead and keeps things fast.

******************************************/

